# Plugin: Writing Plans Adapter

Purpose:
  Adapt Superpowers writing-plans skill for SDDRA S1 arm.

Source:
  D:\Tasks\ai_code\vkard.az\tmp\external-repo-audit\repo-01\skills\writing-plans\SKILL.md

Original:
  Breaks work into bite-sized tasks
  Each task has exact file paths, complete code, verification steps

Adapted for SDDRA:
  Mapped to S1 arm task generation:
    Input: approved docs/
    Output: .sdd/projects/vkard.az/tasks/*.sdd

  Task structure:
    id: TASK-XXX
    title: <one line>
    decision: DEC-XXX (linked decision)
    chain: <chain type>
    dependencies: [TASK IDs]
    skills: [skill paths]
    inputs: [references]
    outputs: [file paths]
    verification: [criteria]

  Integration:
    - Tasks created from approved decisions
    - Each task references parent decision ID
    - Dependencies resolved from project graph

Usage:
  Referenced by:
    .sdd/chains/arms/sdd.sdd

  Triggers:
    - Human approves docs
    - S1 arm execution
    - Task generation needed

State: Adapted
